Fact person Identified by String.
Fact thing Identified by String.
Fact year Identified by Int.

Fact offer Identified by person * thing * year.

Duty offer-must-be-cool
    Holder person1
    Claimant person2
    Related to offer
    Violated when False.

//#violated not offer-must-be-cool(person(Amy), person(Bob), offer(person(Amy), thing(Vase), year(2024))).
